Project: Ownique – HackPrinceton Fall 2026, Business & Enterprise track.
A design marketplace WEBSITE where designers sell a design ONCE. The buyer gets full ownership;
the designer keeps credit forever and can never resell it.

Sponsor tools we MUST use (each one visible in the demo):
Cursor, Grok (xAI), Gemini API, Solana devnet, MongoDB Atlas, Tiger Data,
Vultr (hosting), GoDaddy Registry (domain).
Stack: Next.js 15 (App Router, TypeScript, src/ folder), Tailwind v4, mongoose,
@solana/wallet-adapter (Phantom, devnet).

Already built (starter): wallet login, upload with confirmation checkboxes, Grok descriptions,
shop, design page, policy page, exact-duplicate blocking (SHA-256),
Solana ownership token (Metaplex Core, minted to a vault) + Buy & Own It flow with on-chain payment check.
Next to build: Gemini copy detector + Try It On,
Tiger Data dashboard, reports/admin, Vultr deploy.

Rules: build small working pieces, keep code simple and commented,
secrets only in .env.local, friendly error messages, clean rounded UI.
